"A refusal lets an Avowed decline a summons or quest; they are earned and tracked by the System."
"Refusals are best earned by being summoned often."
"A few bonus refusals may come from traumatizing quests, and some people may award them."
"A quest already running cannot be refused, though a new assignment within it can."
"Separate summoners' quests are counted separately toward the refusal balance."
